[00:00.000]...
[00:22.198]Do you feel alone?
{"你是否感到孤独？"}
[00:25.040]Can you hear me now?
{"此刻能听见我吗？"}
[00:28.073]Your mind is so far away still on earth
{"你的思绪仍滞留尘世 却已飘向远方"}
[00:33.691]Many times you are hurting yourself
{"多少次你都在自我伤害"}
[00:36.471]You can't be just a life on the shelf
{"你不能只是搁置在架上的生命"}
[00:39.418]It's only you that can fly this new unicorn into the sky
{"唯有你能驾驭这新生的独角兽飞向天际"}
[00:44.479]And it's every time, you hurt yourself with knives
{"而每次你总用刀锋划伤自己"}
[00:49.874]And I'm calling, calling out your name again
{"我呼唤着 再次呼喊你的名字"}
[00:55.451]If you're holding, holding onto fear I knew
{"若你紧抓着 我所知的恐惧不放"}
[01:01.039]The blind can open, let light shine through
{"失明者终可睁眼 让光芒穿透"}
[01:06.770]And I say
{"而我说道"}
[01:07.814]Why we can't stop all this sacrifice?
{"为何我们无法停止这些牺牲？"}
[01:13.547]I know that all the lies became the stone in your heart
{"我明白所有谎言都化作你心中的磐石"}
[01:19.038]I wonder how long you gonna survive
{"我想知道你能坚持多久"}
[01:24.638]We didn't see all it's meaning
{"我们未曾看清其中真意"}
[01:30.155]You are the one for me
{"你是我命中注定之人"}
[01:32.821]Finally I can see
{"我终于能看清"}
[01:35.451]Can you promise me
{"能否向我承诺"}
[01:36.904]You'll come back safe and help me?
{"你会平安归来并帮助我？"}
[01:41.048]I'm counting on you to bring the peace we all deserve
{"我指望你带来我们应得的和平"}
[01:45.768]And maybe we'll be able to continue
{"或许我们就能继续前行"}
[01:51.431]And it's every time, you hurt yourself with knives
{"而每次你总用刀锋划伤自己"}
[01:56.911]And I'm calling, calling out your name again
{"我呼唤着 再次呼喊你的名字"}
